<view class="page {{role}} "><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="note">MOCK 选号页：暂无福彩接入资料，因此使用原生模拟页。未来的 web-view 只允许白名单 HTTPS 地址，返回消息仅触发查单。</view><view class="heading-title">选一份属于你的幸运</view><view class="subtitle">请选择 6 个演示号码，已选 {{pickedNumbers.length}} / 6</view><view class="number-grid"><view wx:for="{{numberChoices}}" wx:key="n" class="ball {{item.selected?'selected':''}}" bindtap="toggleNumber" data-n="{{item.n}}">{{item.n}}</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="finishSelection" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认模拟选号</button></block></view>